        "candidate_id": "C_04187c1a22dd7ea2_0",
        "edit": "Swap the mux branch assignments so that s==1 selects b and s==0 selects a, correcting the inverted select polarity that caused the cycle-2 output mismatch.",
        "lens_id": "generic_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module mux21(a,b,s,y);\n\tinput a,b,s;\n\toutput y;\n\treg y;\n\talways @(a,b,s)\n\tif(s==1) y=b;\n\telse y=a;\nendmodule",
